  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">1. 1~4단원 중 과학책에서 마음에 드는 과학 그림 그려서 제출하기 (슈링클스-색연필로 그려서 다양한 색감 가능, 1/7크기로 줄어 연필은 좀 번지게 결과물이 나옴)<br><br>-  2학년</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0b151d883eb7f825b519688eaf6b753532724f08\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0b151d883eb7f825b519688eaf6b753532724f08\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"2421\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">- 3학년</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/af0b61edbcfa1eecc0a4c1ea4afb7922867330cd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/af0b61edbcfa1eecc0a4c1ea4afb7922867330cd\" data-origin-width=\"3837\" data-origin-height=\"2714\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/641d2940b6cb88d0da7e66c2f8d021a4ae324859\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/641d2940b6cb88d0da7e66c2f8d021a4ae324859\" data-origin-width=\"1020\" data-origin-height=\"628\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/561d69d67bc9c5cdc5db7ac8875e20a1c1318dec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/561d69d67bc9c5cdc5db7ac8875e20a1c1318dec\" data-origin-width=\"791\" data-origin-height=\"543\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>2. 원하는 작품 만들어가기(열쇠고리 제공)<br> -nct 엄청 열정적으로 그렸어요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/47b7a0b546337ba646a16cd300fdac969bb083f5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/47b7a0b546337ba646a16cd300fdac969bb083f5\" data-origin-width=\"643\" data-origin-height=\"857\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br> - 아래는 ps판 입니다. ps판은 유성펜으로 그려요. 번짐은 덜 하나, 슈링클스와는 약간 다른 느낌</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5be5ab0b1f733147c92f4616e9f41dfdef1737cd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5be5ab0b1f733147c92f4616e9f41dfdef1737cd\" data-origin-width=\"728\" data-origin-height=\"654\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>3. 1시간 활동으로 좋아요<br> - 슈링클스&amp;스테들러색연필과 ps판&amp;유성펜<br>모두 준비했고, 아이들은 슈링클스를 더 좋아했어요</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}